        "text_5": "<p>No mycelium. No starch. No harmful additives.<br> Just 100% organic lion’s mane fruiting bodies <br>— rich in compounds that support healthy <br>cognitive function and promote gut and <br>immune system health.*</p>",
        "mobile_text_1": "<p>OVER 10,000 HAPPY CUSTOMERS</p>",
        "mobile_text_2": "<h1>Tired of Forgetting Things &amp; Having brain fog?</h1>",
        "mobile_text_3": "<p>You’re not broken — and it’s not about drinking more stimulants. What your mind needs is real nutrition to restore balance and clarity.</p>",
        "mobile_text_4": "<h2>Boost <span style=\"font-family: 'Superior Title Italic'; text-transform: capitalize;\">cognitive Performance</span><br> with Tribe Organics<br> Lion’s Mane powder</h2>",
        "mobile_text_5": "<p>No mycelium. No starch. No harmful additives. Just 100% organic lion’s mane fruiting bodies, rich in compounds that support healthy cognitive function and promote gut and immune system health.*</p>",
        "button_text": "BUY NOW",
        "button_url": "#dgf-featured-product",
        "button_text_color": "#ffffff",
        "first_column_image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_4.webp",
