    "dgf_testimonial_3K9HUd": {
      "type": "dgf-testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_twg3Cy": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I absolutely have had an awesome experience taking these. So has my partner. We both feel so clear minded, natural energy, and have had a TON of anxiety released. I subscribed because of the impact it’s had on my life! I’m able to take a step back & think from a higher awareness now!! Love their product & how pure of mushroom it is.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Carly Camargo"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_aMr8hV": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I switched from coffee to Masala Chai with milk and honey, and while drinking this flavorful delight, I take Lion’s Maine and suddenly this calm clarity comes over me. Far better than the jolt of coffee, and its acidity.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Kimberly Marlow"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_th8VmB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>The product arrive on time and the package was very well protected. I bought the product for my wife whose having some episodes of forgetting things. She started to use the product a week and a half ago and I think that it is to early to see results.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "-Victor M Arroyo"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_7nxzYB": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Took about 3 weeks to feel more focused and improvement with my memory. I will definitely continue using your products. I also use Turmeric complex.\t</p>",
            "author_name": "- Todd Bajar"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_GKn6zU": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Terrific product. This is a nice supplement.\t\t\t</p>",
            "author_name": "- Christopher"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LUbrbx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I love Tribe Organics Lion Mane. My mind is sharper and my mood is more content with who I am. Life is good!</p>",
            "author_name": "-Karen Zapata"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_9hbXrt": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Took about 3 weeks to feel more focused and improvement with my memory. I will definitely continue using your products. I also use turmeric.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Todd Bajar"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_LRPKbG": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>The lion’s mane provides a subtle difference that did take some time to notice (2-3 weeks) but I did feel like it was working. This especially became apparent after I stopped taking it. It really must've helped with my digestion because after I stopped taking it, I would get heartburn more often. I just ordered more and will continue to use this product as I got good results from taking it</p>",
            "author_name": "-Arthur"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_aFUCCM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Very potent lions mane. Definitely feel the difference compared to other products I’ve tried.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "-Mike"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_48ALbb": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I bought Lions Mane looking for ways yo help post-partum anxiety. I have subtly felt sharper and lighter since taking them. I like the idea of using natural alternatives. I take one or two every few days and my subscription has lasted Aug-Oct. Buying for the second time now.</p>",
            "author_name": "-New Mom"
          }
        }
      },
